# ---- the drawn-weapon LOCO (P2b production, FOLK-BODY): `guard`, the weapon hand in a ready guard; its `grip` mark is
# where held weapons hang their `guard` views (held/weapons/sword.pxm). R and L are A3's recover arm (swing.py r3 / l3)
# split from its blade, so the composed guard is A3's recover pixel for pixel; D and U hold the blade out to the weapon
# side (up-left facing down, up-right facing up), clear of the face and of the off hand.
view D key guard origin 1 -1
mark handR 0 5
mark grip 0 5
